{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_phatom_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_phatom_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "合作",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_phatom_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7521050b15b06024be302c687d770d42792e685b03df13b7fea0241fb6063f6f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛本舰\n某个偏僻的角落"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清除异物、愈合伤口、擦干血迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所能做的，只有这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更精细的治疗，你需要医疗部专业医师的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这些就足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要到哪里去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回我该去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该去的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说......独自一个人的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你不去和小队的人一起庆祝吗？你们这次的任务很重要，他们都很高兴，你也可以一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "庆祝的时刻不必有我。正午的阳光下不必有阴影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许该去参加庆祝的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......我不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请随意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我该离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——给我慢着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总算找到你了，傀影干员！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絮雨医师，您之前是在帮他处理伤口吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然您不是正式编制的医疗部医师，但我还是有责任提醒您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据《罗德岛伤员管理与治疗条例》上的章程，所有受伤干员必须在罗德岛医疗部进行登记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像您这样私下为干员治疗伤口，小伤小病也就算了，万一傀影干员因为您的不完全治疗导致任何并发症或伤口恶化，医疗部会很头疼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很对不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要求絮雨小姐进行治疗的是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有非难她的必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是向她陈述事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于你，傀影干员，你的问题更严重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受伤之后为什么不来医疗部报到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是与你一同参加外勤任务的蓝毒小姐在接受治疗时向我报告了你的情况，你是不是想把这伤痛带到下一场战斗中去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是对罗德岛的不负责，也是对你自己的不负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你能认识到这点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的过错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向您致歉，医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我接受你的道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，我要对你进行诊疗以全面确认你的身体状况，可以吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别摆出那副表情，等等，别开口，不许出声，别想用你的源石技艺溜走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不会再上一次当的，只要我认知到半点不对劲我就立刻按这个报警按钮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "墙壁上原来还有这种按钮吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放轻松，我没有要带着你走过大厅然后进入医疗部的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蓝毒小姐和我说了，你不喜欢人多的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我把设备都带来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会帮你进行医疗信息的收集和整理，然后和絮雨医师一起为你处理伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以吧，絮雨医师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您认可吗，傀影干员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（默默颔首）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我立刻为你进行诊疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以的话，能为我描述伤口位置和大致情况吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么不说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（指指抿起的嘴巴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，是因为亚叶小姐刚才说，不许开口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（白眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在可以了，请说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......弩箭刺穿肩膀、利刃划过手掌、寒冰束缚双足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肩膀，刺穿伤；利器对手部造成伤害；低温......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "右腿没受什么影响，但左小腿好像没完全恢复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我们一个一个来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肩膀刺穿伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚为他做了伤口愈合，应该没有什么大碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......如果只是普通的金属箭矢倒还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清创做了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经处理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从愈合情况上来看应该不存在中毒或者感染的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，下一个位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌心割裂伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，愈合得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，身上受到两处外伤，创口感染的可能性也会大幅提升，一会我会为你打预防针，这样感染方面的问题就不用担心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后，左小腿冻伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事的，你就这样别动，我带了专门的检测仪器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能会有点痛，请忍一忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "样本已采集\n分析开始——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等数据出来，我就可以下最终的诊断决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有其他不适或受伤的部位吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（Miss.Christine？好像叼着什么......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你在听我说话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。没有，没有其他伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傀影干员的恢复能力的确很出众。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有可能真的是我过虑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傀影干——傀影先生是特种干员吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们是这样喊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你身上的这几种伤口类型，我在先锋和重装干员身上见的比较多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说你们这次的任务很艰难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“幸亏有他的支援，我们才能活着回来。”这样的话，我已经从许多人口中听到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他们大多不知道你的代号，甚至都没有见过你的模样，只知道在战场上闪过的影子帮了他们一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记住我对他们没有好处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这话我听腻了。我治疗过的部分干员总喜欢强调这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不说这个，别扯太多有的没的。在这里的人大多数都没那么天真，或许哪一天我们会分道扬镳，搞不好哪天真的就兵戎相见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但傀影先生，就算是我多管闲事......我觉得我得告诉你，至少在现在，他们只是想表达自己的感激之情，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些话，如果在能说的时候不说给别人听，之后或许就再也没有机会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（轻声）......别像我一样犯傻，把事情都憋在心里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蓝毒说，你帮她挡下了一支弩箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想感谢你，但却找不到你，所以托我带了些东西过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这枚胸针，是她赠送给你的礼物，请你收下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会向她传达我的谢意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "分析已结束\n正在输出分析报告"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傀影先生，你能尝试活动一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（略微不协调地走动）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，足够了，请先坐下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是源石技艺造成温度骤降后导致的冻伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不严重，但已经影响到你行动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是些小伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于病痛的鉴别，请以医疗人士的专业意见作为参考，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傀影先生近期最好静养。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我的意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我同意絮雨医师的观点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "表面上是冻伤，但实质上还是源石技艺致伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的感染状况本就不容乐观，对于一切可能增加你感染进程的情况，我们都要尽力避免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "充分休息，健康饮食，进行适当的修复性运动，这是你现在所需要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，最重要的，还是定期来医疗部接受治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疗程不会太长，只要一个月，你就能重新参加任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不喜欢来医疗部，我可以帮你安排巡诊，减少你和他人的接触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果同意的话，请在这份告知书最末尾签字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（再次叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（签上了自己的代号）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，谢谢合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在该给您打针了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是新式的注射器，不会产生太多疼痛感的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请把手伸出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（使用注射器）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，这样前期的预防治疗算是大功告成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我下午还有会议，就不继续打扰你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请好好享受一个月的假期，傀影先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......我还是不太习惯和亚叶小姐搭话，总是会紧张......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss.Christine。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（蹭了蹭傀影。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来的假期，就请傀影先生好好休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假期？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来没有想过。假期，该做什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，比如......观影?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是我，我会去看一场电影，然后将那时的心情记录下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时候，我总会幻想自己像影片中的人那样生活，同时，又能矛盾地感觉到自己真实地在屏幕外呼吸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......当心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幻想去过别人的生活，并不是一件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，只是，这是我习惯的放松方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......这么说有些不好意思，只是好像有一些干员，很喜欢读我写下来的那些东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我并不认为自己写得很好，但如果大家能够喜欢的话，我觉得这样也不坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_130",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss.Christine？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很痒，不要这样......嗯？这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜，她可能是想让您看看这张传单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“多媒体密室项目诚征工作人员数名——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“需要相关人员负责设计密室整体紧迫而压抑的探险氛围。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“需要相关人员设计密室中的解密与机关。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“需要相关人员——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——进行扮演。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“企划及运营为期一个月。期间支付薪金，包一日三餐。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“有兴趣的干员和留岛人员请至人事部详谈。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多媒体密室......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说是一种强调感官刺激和浸入式体验的新型娱乐方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像......大部分密室主题都以恐怖与悬疑为主要元素。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前一段时间还见到过一次，当时的主题是米诺斯的地下迷宫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我其实很想去试试看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是那一天A1小队的干员体验完毕后和我说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“吓死我了！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，她们说这话的时候看上去很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（恐惧，但却喜悦？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傀影",
      "speakerId": "char_250_phantom",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唔......喜欢受到惊吓？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我当时没敢去，现在想起来，又有点后悔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
